    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to your wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/b8149612dbdcca71f854967ce19befa2.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/b8149612dbdcca71f854967ce19befa2.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/b8149612dbdcca71f854967ce19befa2.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Number Machine is an open-ended factory and automation game with math mechanics. Design, build, and optimize factories that automatically assemble and deliver complex numerical structures. Inspired by Opus Magnum and Infinifactory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Build fully autonomous factories on a hexagonal grid using specialized machines. Move, combine, split, destroy, and modify numbered orbs with math to form the required structures with specific shapes and values.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use conveyors, pushers, lasers, magnetism, rotators, and much more to create an efficient system. Optimize for size and speed to climb the leaderboards... but be wary: one small oversight and your entire design can fail<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game features a unique cel-shaded art style that gives it a colorful, clean, and stylized look. All animations are seamless, with a single continuous camera movement from start to finish to keep you fully immersed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/3bc71897127d9aa9314eaa9feb1b8ec1.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Number Machine is an open-ended factory and automation game with math mechanics. Design, build, and optimize factories that automatically assemble and deliver complex numerical structures. Inspired by Opus Magnum and Infinifactory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/7f669c3059d14b21f6dbdfb702b5a2fb.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Build fully autonomous factories on a hexagonal grid using specialized machines. Move, combine, split, destroy, and modify numbered orbs with math to form the required structures with specific shapes and values.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/c69d861f77634aa71e267c79a64ccf37.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Use conveyors, pushers, lasers, magnetism, rotators, and much more to create an efficient system. Optimize for size and speed to climb the leaderboards... but be wary: one small oversight and your entire design can fail<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.poster.avif?t=1755012068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.webm?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2231090/extras/964143407fb2ccfff8dac3f5791c84b5.mp4?t=1755012068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game features a unique cel-shaded art style that gives it a colorful, clean, and stylized look. All animations are seamless, with a single continuous camera movement from start to finish to keep you fully immersed.</p>",
